# XORA Anon mode: a dedicated Tor instance that carries ALL of this computer's traffic.
# Separate from any Tor the user runs themselves (different ports and data directory).
# Ports: SELinux lets Tor listen only on its own port type (6969, 9001, 9030, 9050, 9051, 9150) and on DNS (53):
# 9150 SOCKS (Tor Browser's port), 9030 transparent proxy, 53 on 127.0.0.1 for DNS (resolved uses 127.0.0.53).
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor/xora-anon
RunAsDaemon 0
SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9150
TransPort 127.0.0.1:9030 IsolateClientAddr IsolateDestAddr IsolateDestPort
DNSPort 127.0.0.1:53
VirtualAddrNetworkIPv4 10.192.0.0/10
AutomapHostsOnResolve 1
AvoidDiskWrites 1
Log notice stdout
